{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12226520","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12226520","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1222652001:1":{"text":"哎呀~不要怀疑人家啦！人家是绝对不会说谎的哦。","source_cn":"哎呀~不要怀疑人家啦！人家是绝对不会说谎的哦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBB16E83E3B44DF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222652002:1":{"text":"那个通缉犯虽然有着惨白的皮肤，但长相还蛮可爱嘛。","source_cn":"那个通缉犯虽然有着惨白的皮肤，但长相还蛮可爱嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22FD8F588897AF69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222652003:1":{"text":"你是在哪里见到她的？","source_cn":"你是在哪里见到她的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x788411DCB41D72F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222652004:1":{"text":"人家每天都会出城采花，今天大清早，我在南门外的树林里看见她了。","source_cn":"人家每天都会出城采花，今天大清早，我在南门外的树林里看...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x248BD2D0465C3CA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222652005:1":{"text":"人家不想要什么赏金，可不可以请索尼娅小姐来人家的花店坐坐呢？","source_cn":"人家不想要什么赏金，可不可以请索尼娅小姐来人家的花店坐坐呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE54FA3AA7A450A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","docu